CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Rust implementation of CSS Syntax Level 3

Local Modifications:
Updated with tools/import.py rust-cssparser (history replayed linearly); how far behind it is: `bun testing/acceptance.ts track`.
The crates (3) live in third_party/rust-cssparser/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/rust-cssparser/ unchanged.

Crates:
  cssparser 0.38.0 third_party/rust-cssparser/cssparser
  cssparser-color 0.6.0 third_party/rust-cssparser/cssparser-color
  cssparser-macros 0.7.1 third_party/rust-cssparser/cssparser-macros
